      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">假设交易者买入</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">一标准手欧元/美元</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">，在美元账户中，每个pip约为</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">$10</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">。平仓前市场中间价保持不变。</span>"
