    {
      "key": "t2dfa21120c06e7e4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is a market maker broker?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是做市商经纪商？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcc1580e4ee8c0470",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A market maker broker provides bid and ask quotes and may act as counterparty to client trades. It may internalize exposure, match opposing orders or hedge externally. This creates a potential conflict, but regulated firms can manage it through transparent policies and controls.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">做市商经纪商提供买入和卖出报价，并可以充当客户交易的对手方。它可以内部化风险敞口、匹配相反的订单或外部对冲。这会产生潜在的冲突，但受监管的公司可以通过透明的政策和控制来管理它。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0a0535016c1bae11",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Risk Disclaimer:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Forex and CFD trading is leveraged, involves significant risk and may not be suitable for everyone. Losses may exceed the initial deposit. Past performance does not guarantee future results. Trade only with funds you can afford to lose and review the full</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">risk disclosure</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">风险免责声明：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">外汇和差价合约交易是杠杆交易，涉及重大风险，可能并不适合所有人。损失可能超过初始存款。过去的表现并不能保证未来的结果。仅使用您可以承受损失的资金进行交易，并查看完整的</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">风险披露</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5f2047d9ea55b9ed",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CFDs are leveraged products. Gains and losses are calculated from the full exposure rather than only the margin deposited, and losses may exceed the initial deposit depending on the product, jurisdiction and protections. This article is educational and is not personalized financial advice.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约是杠杆产品。收益和损失是根据全部风险敞口计算的，而不仅仅是存入的保证金，根据产品、司法管辖区和保护措施，损失可能会超过初始存款。本文具有教育意义，并非个性化的财务建议。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0070970c5d18a63c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Stock CFD, and Why Trade One During Earnings Season?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是股票差价合约，为什么在财报季节进行交易？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9fe506f04d3a9284",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stock CFD reflects the price movement of a company’s shares without transferring ownership. The trader exchanges the difference between the position’s opening and closing values.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">股票差价合约反映了公司股票的价格变动，但不转移所有权。交易者交换头寸的开仓价和平仓价之间的差额。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta58581613f306fd1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">During earnings season, CFDs allow traders to:</span>",
