        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在财报季期间，差价合约允许交易者：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9a158872b6a3e906",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Open long or short positions</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
