      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3。检查波动环境</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0b6eb0acf75e6caa",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. Calculate Position Size and Margin</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4。计算头寸规模和保证金</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2ef222389ea25226",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Set the maximum acceptable monetary loss before choosing volume. Consider the stop distance, available margin, possible gap, costs and related positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在选择交易量之前设置最大可接受的货币损失。考虑止损距离、可用保证金、可能的缺口、成本和相关仓位。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te37c9adfe3ebe553",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A long position expresses an expectation of a rise; a short position expresses an expectation of a decline. Staying flat is valid when the potential gap cannot fit the risk plan.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">多头持仓表达上涨预期，空头持仓表达下跌预期。当可能出现的跳空无法纳入风险计划时，保持空仓也是合理的选择。</span>"
    },
